Position
Software Engineer II
Location:
Tysons, VA
Description
Develops and designs excellent time & expense software, solving problems and engineering solutions. Analyze, implement, and troubleshoot systems. Test, implement, and debug software products and applications.
Requirements
3+ years of relevant experience working as application development/software project manager for a software development company or an app development agency;
3+ years of prior web software programming experience;
A degree in computer science, engineering, or a relevant field from an accredited U.S. college;
Must be able to work in small development team;
Excellent troubleshooting and problem-solving skills;
Ability to handle multiple projects simultaneously in an agile and fast-paced environment.
Send Resume

